cff-version: 1.2.0
message: 'To cite package "R6.tiledb" in publications use:'
type: software
license: MIT
title: 'R6.tiledb: R6 Classes for TileDB Arrays and Groups'
version: 0.3.3
abstract: Provides foundational R6 classes to interface with 'TileDB' storage engine
  using 'tiledb' package. The goal is to offer a set of minimum classes based on the
  R6 object oriented system in order to make it easier to work with 'TileDB' Arrays
  and Groups. The base classes 'TileDBArray' and 'TileDBGroup' can be easily extended
  to new subclasses to represent and support any data model.
